  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Walking through Susukino at night, the protagonist spots magazines sealed in clear plastic wrap so browsers cannot peek inside without buying. When his new partner tells him they sell over a million copies every month, he drops all hesitation and marches straight toward a shop called Showtime. Listen to the finale of Episode One.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これは何だ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ビニールに包まれた中身が見えない本だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "中身を隠して買わせる新しい本なんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "これを考えた人は頭が切れるよな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これ、月にどのぐらい売れてるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "月に百万冊以上は売れてるらしい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "百万冊！？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "トシ、これを仕入れることはできるか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "急に呼び捨てかよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ、あのショータイムだ。もう後戻りできないぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "行ってくる。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ビニールに包まれた中身が見えない本だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is a book wrapped in vinyl so you cannot see the contents.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "中身を隠して買わせる新しい本なんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It hides what is inside to make people buy it—a new kind of book.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "これを考えた人は頭が切れるよな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whoever thought this up is really sharp.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これ、月にどのぐらい売れてるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Roughly how many of these sell per month?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "月に百万冊以上は売れてるらしい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over a million copies a month, apparently.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "トシ、これを仕入れることはできるか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Toshi, can we stock these?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "急に呼び捨てかよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He says 'Suddenly calling me by my bare first name, huh?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "もう後戻りできないぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is no turning back anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "行ってくる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am going in.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
