    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Congratulations on finishing all of Episode One! You learned the word for contents, the phrase for a sharp mind, the term for dropping polite titles, and saw the everyday doorway phrase come full circle. Until Episode Two—see you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
